OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree resolution document 'not
OL,4,Aacceptable', says DUP MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter hours in discussion with
OL,7,Fgovernment officials at Hillsborough
OL,8,FCastle on Wednesday Breandan Mac
OL,9,FCionnaith said the GRRC "received a
OL,10,Fdocument from the secretary of state"
OL,11,Fbut added: "Let's say if it's accepted
OL,12,Fby the Orange Order it'll be accepted
OL,13,Fby us."
OL,15,FTalks with Sir Chris Bryant came after
OL,16,Flawyers for the GRRC issued a fresh
OL,17,Flegal bid on Tuesday to try to prevent
OL,18,Fthe march from going ahead.
